# Native six-simplex classes and their geometric relations

The original based six-simplex gives a native sixth homotopy class, whose
Hurewicz image is its actual corrected singular cycle.  The recursive
six-cube chain is the signed sum of its 720 affine permutation simplices.
Native recovery and the eight-face relation use the frozen generic
theorems, without new dimension-specific geometric arguments.
